        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "description": "<p>The sample starting Character from the printed sheet (p379): a Scholarly Investigator who Explores Dark Places. Tier 1, ready to play.</p>",
        "notes": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Your mother was an Egyptologist who kept bringing home odd little finds from her digs. Her stories are the reason you went looking into the past yourself, and into the dark places where the past is still waiting.</p><h2>Connections</h2><p>Pick one other PC. They have been your companion on earlier investigations, and the pair of you work together well enough that you each gain an asset on any roll made while collaborating on the same noncombat task.</p><h2>Character Arc</h2><p><strong>Assist an Organization:</strong> your research lines up neatly with the group you belong to, which exists to document supernatural events.</p><h2>Equipment Notes</h2><p><strong>Provided by the organization:</strong> laptop, secure briefcase.</p><p><strong>Additional:</strong> a replica hieroglyph stamp set, a gift from your mother.</p>",
        "gmNotes": "",
